    "name":  "Pendant Lamp | RATTAN BATAM | for LED E27",
    "reference":  "RPD92103",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRattan Pendant Lamp for LED E27,\u003c/strong\u003e Add a touch of distinction and warmth to your home with this rattan pendant lamp. \u003cstrong\u003eIts natural and elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e integrates perfectly with modern and minimalist styles, creating a cozy and sophisticated atmosphere in any space. Ideal for those seeking functional lighting with a unique decorative touch. Transform your space with style and light!\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/en/led-bulbs-lamps/base-types/e27\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE27 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePendant Light - RATTAN BATAM\u0026nbsp;- for E27 LED\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003eRattan Pendant Light for E27 LED bulbs\u003c/strong\u003e, the perfect way to transform any space with its natural, elegant design. This light is ideal for anyone who wants to add a unique, welcoming decorative touch to their home or business without giving up the functionality and efficiency of modern lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe light is made from rattan,\u003c/strong\u003e a natural material made up of fine strips from climbing palms, generally from asia, woven together to form a unique and distinctive structure. This construction technique not only enhances its look, it also gives it exceptional durability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Elegant, Minimalist Design:\u003c/strong\u003e The rattan pendant light stands out for its sophisticated, minimalist design, which fits perfectly with a wide range of decorating styles, from modern to bohemian. Its clean lines and rattan structure bring an air of warmth and nature, making this light a key decorative feature in any room.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- High-Quality Materials:\u003c/strong\u003e Made from fine rattan strips, this light not only offers a unique look, it also guarantees durability and strength. Rattan, known for its flexibility and resilience, provides a solid structure that at the same time allows a gentle filtering of light, creating a soft, relaxing atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Compatible with E27 LED Bulbs:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to work with E27 LED bulbs, this light lets you choose the colour temperature and light intensity that best suit your needs. LED bulbs are not only more energy efficient, they also last longer, helping you save on your electricity bill and reducing your environmental impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Easy Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to be practical and functional, the rattan pendant light is easy to install. It comes with all the components needed for assembly, so you can enjoy your new lighting in a matter of minutes, hassle-free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Pleasant Atmosphere:\u003c/strong\u003eThe texture of the rattan allows a soft diffusion of light, creating welcoming, sophisticated spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Sustainability:\u003c/strong\u003e Made from natural materials and compatible with LED bulbs, this light is an eco-friendly choice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e It adapts to a wide variety of uses, both at home and in commercial settings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses and Applications of the\u0026nbsp;RATTAN BATAM Pendant Light\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Residential Spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for living rooms, dining rooms, bedrooms or any other area of your home where you want to create a welcoming, elegant atmosphere. Its versatile design fits perfectly in both small and large spaces, adding a touch of distinction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Commercial Applications:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for restaurants, cafés, boutiques or waiting rooms looking for lighting that is both functional and decorative. The rattan pendant light does not just provide light, it also becomes a focal point that can enhance your customers\u0027 experience and add aesthetic value to your business.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Event Decoration:\u003c/strong\u003e This light is an excellent choice for decorating special events such as weddings, outdoor dinners or themed parties. Its natural, warm style helps create unforgettable settings that capture the attention of every guest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e* Bulb NOT INCLUDED\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide everything needed for WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or SALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
